<title>SWEDEN: Swedish retail sales rose 0.3 pct in Jan.</title>
<headline>Swedish retail sales rose 0.3 pct in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish retail sales rose 0.3 percent in January, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    (Percentage change)	   Jan 97     year to date</p>
<p>    Retail sales		    +0.3	 +0.3</p>
<p>    - in non-specialised stores -0.8	 -0.8</p>
<p>    - in specialised stores     +1.7	 +1.7</p>
<p>-- Belinda Goldsmith, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
